ingredients:
  - "1/2 cup split Bengal gram (chana dal)"
  - "1 whole egg"
  - "2-3 green chilies, finely chopped"
  - "1-inch piece of ginger, grated"
  - "Salt to taste"
  - "1 onion, finely chopped"
  - "1 carrot, grated"
  - "Fresh coriander leaves, finely chopped"
instructions:
  - "Soak chana dal in water for 4-6 hours. Drain and rinse."
  - "Blend the soaked dal with green chilies, ginger, and salt to make a coarse paste."
  - "Mix in egg, chopped onions, grated carrots, and coriander leaves."
  - "Heat a non-stick pan, grease it with oil, and pour a ladleful of batter."
  - "Spread the batter evenly to make a thin pancake."
  - "Cook until crispy and golden brown on both sides."
  - "Serve hot with a side of green chutney."
